        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cabery%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village sits on the county line, with Kankakee and Ford counties meeting right on Main Street.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cabery%2C_Illinois",
