      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A fire on May 3, 1885, gutted the south side of Main Street, destroying 24 businesses and 14 homes but caused no injuries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        13,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cabery%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Cabery High School operated from 1912 to 1946, and its football team, the Cabery Cardinals, once played against inmates from Joliet Correctional Center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
